  "contents": [{
    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "We are pleased to announce the release of Fumadocs OpenAPI v10.\nThis major release focuses on enhancing customization capabilities and simplifying API surfaces, it is also an opportunity to drop older/deprecated APIs."
  }, {
    "heading": undefined,
    "content": "We have introduced multiple breaking changes that require attention during upgrades."
  }, {
    "heading": "redesign-of-createopenapi-usage",
    "content": "This redesign separates API page and server concerns, removes disablePlayground option in favor of playground.enabled, introduces client configuration support, and prefers client configs for adapters."
  }, {
    "heading": "redesign-of-createopenapi-usage",
    "content": "Isolation of API Page and Server:"
  }, {
    "heading": "redesign-of-createopenapi-usage",
    "content": "Previously, all options are located in createOpenAPI()."
  }, {
    "heading": "redesign-of-createopenapi-usage",
    "content": "Now, you need to separate API page components and the server declaration."
  }, {
    "heading": "redesign-of-createopenapi-usage",
    "content": "More Options for Playground:\nUse playground.enabled instead of disablePlayground."
  }, {
    "heading": "redesign-of-createopenapi-usage",
    "content": "Client Configuration Support:"
  }, {
    "heading": "redesign-of-createopenapi-usage",
    "content": "The options are now split into server/client configs, some options are moved to the client-side config,"
  }, {
    "heading": "redesign-of-createopenapi-usage",
    "content": "Client-Side Media Adapters:\nAlso forward your media adapters via client config."
  }, {
    "heading": "renaming-options",
    "content": "The option content.showExampleInFields has been renamed to schemaUI.showExample."
  }, {
    "heading": "removal-of-centralized-renderer-and-fields-apis",
    "content": "Fumadocs OpenAPI now prefers per-feature customizations, eliminating the centralized renderer API. Custom render functions are now specified directly in the content option when creating an API page."
  }, {
    "heading": "removal-of-centralized-renderer-and-fields-apis",
    "content": "For migrating Playground fields options, utilize client-side render APIs:"
  }, {
    "heading": "removal-of-centralized-renderer-and-fields-apis",
    "content": "Additional layout customizations are available:"
  }, {
    "heading": "generatefiles-requires-openapi-server",
    "content": "File generation is now handled within the OpenAPI server. The input field for generateFiles must reference the server instance rather than a string array of file paths."
  }, {
    "heading": "storage-key-prefix",
    "content": "v10 introduced the storageKeyPrefix option to prevent state bleed across multiple OpenAPI instances by isolating localStorage keys."
  }, {
    "heading": "bug-fixes",
    "content": "TypeScript Schema Output Correction: Resolved incorrect TypeScript schema generation. Code formatting is disabled in this process to enhance performance."
  }, {
    "heading": "bug-fixes",
    "content": "We recommend reviewing your implementation against these changes to leverage the improved flexibility and performance.\nIf you encounter issues, welcome to contribute feedback to our GitHub repository."
  }],
  "headings": [{
